<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech PM calls capital mkts meeting for Sunday.</title>
<headline>Czech PM calls capital mkts meeting for Sunday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Prime Minister Vaclav Klaus has called a meeting of the country's top economic ministers and capital markets experts to discuss the regulation and strengthening of its capital markets.</p>
<p>&quot;On Sunday, there will be a working meeting of the Prime Minister with selected circle of experts on the situation in the capital markets and suggestions for its regulation and strengthening,&quot; a statement from the Prime Minister's office said.</p>
</text>
